{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達董事會11月8日宣佈，將針對有關行政總裁黃仁勳個人關聯事項的指控啓動獨立調查。受相關風波影響，黃仁勳的去留成為市場焦點。當地時間9日，英偉達股價走低，最終收跌4.27%，報每股178.67美元，市值縮水約1930億美元（約合人民幣12882億元）。而在美股收盤五分鐘後，英偉達及黃仁勳便遭到股東集體訴訟，指控其涉嫌欺詐股東。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585720.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.133529+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:19:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"e04a2a01eb7bf74b9b41125db1680ef1243bdcf3aa3ee3e0aa5b7c0b531d602d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}